        <rule id="9b61d6d2-924c-5a69-bbb1-a90b6099b38a" name="Subterranean Assault" hidden="false">
          <description>You may place up to 10 Infantry models in Reserve with this unit during Deployment. Once this model Deepstrikes successfully, the unit may Deepstrike within 6” without scattering.</description>
