            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="1c2f4080-02ec-5486-826a-4d2299dd0bb1">In your Command Phase you may declare if the Gate is Open or Closed. Models may not move through the Gate when it is Closed. The Gate cannot be Closed if models are Obstructing the Gate.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
