        </rule>
        <rule id="025c9f1f-8990-5a0a-8f75-196f21e45e6c" name="Aura of Discipline" hidden="false">
          <description>6” Aura, unit may use Commissar’s Ld and gains Stubborn</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="11fc70f7-4802-590e-a6e6-269d10281fad" name="Send in the Next Wave" hidden="false">
          <description>In your Command Phase, you may spawn an existing Conscript unit from your list that has been destroyed or declare an existing Conscript unit dead by removing them from the fields. This replacement unit moves onto the table edge of your deployment zone as if it had Outflanked. This may only occur once per Round and may affect the same unit any number of times over the course of the game.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
